      "value": "@{61aab2681ba18a4b39c2eeb5|full_name} Is there not a way to add functionality to animating materials that use the same mesh separately in other ways? My request is using poi's locking feature as an example because it solves that issue, not me saying that it needs to be solved in the exact same way. I am not very knowledgeable about how shaders are made or work but I feel as though VRC could make a system for their shader that makes it so you can animate multiple materials separately while they are on the same mesh. Doesn't need to be the locking or renaming feature that poi has.",
