      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is not possible in the way that community shaders do it, due to how we handle shader loading on mobile platforms. However, the upcoming Avatar Optimizer (teased in our developer updates on the ask forums) will allow you to separate meshes and animate them individually without paying the cost for performance rank. The optimizer will automatically merge the meshes and rewrite animations to only affect the correct parts automatically.",
